{"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Type Method","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setEmail:","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"setEmail:","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)setEmail:","title":"setEmail:","symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setEmail:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"NSString","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"email","kind":"internalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"platforms":["iOS"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"email","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The user’s email address (must be valid and non-empty)","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Register an email for the current user to enable:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Email-based campaigns and targeting","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cross-device user identification"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Email channel for multi-channel messaging","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Example","text":"Example","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Set email after user verification:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["class UserAccountManager {","","    func handleEmailVerification(email: String, verificationCode: String) async throws {","        \/\/ Verify email with backend","        try await APIClient.shared.verifyEmail(email: email, code: verificationCode)","","        \/\/ Update Pushwoosh with verified email","        Pushwoosh.configure.setEmail(email)","","        \/\/ Update tags to reflect verified status","        Pushwoosh.configure.setTags([","            \"email_verified\": true,","            \"email_verified_date\": Date()","        ])","","        Logger.info(\"Email verified and synced with Pushwoosh: \\(email)\")","    }","","    func handleProfileUpdate(email: String?, phone: String?) {","        if let email = email, !email.isEmpty {","            Pushwoosh.configure.setEmail(email)","        }","","        \/\/ Update other contact methods via tags","        var tags: [String: Any] = [:]","        if let phone = phone {","            tags[\"phone_number\"] = phone","        }","        if !tags.isEmpty {","            Pushwoosh.configure.setTags(tags)","        }","    }","}"]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setEmail:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/setemail:"]}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Associates an email address with the current device."}],"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PWConfiguration"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration","type":"topic","title":"PWConfiguration"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCo